# BRAVADO: monsters come out of the four corner pads a few at a time, the
# bigger the prize the quicker (100 frames apart at 100, 30 at 900 and
# over), and never more than twelve on the floor at once: the rest wait
# their turn. A spawn comes from one of the two pads farthest from Dice.
game bravado
wait 5
expect spawn_interval100 == 100
expect spawn_interval500 == 65
expect spawn_interval900 == 30
expect spawn_interval1000 == 30
expect spawn_interval1600 == 30
cheat run 1
cheat round 3
cheat nolineup
cheat group 2 6
cheat group 2 6
cheat group 2 6
cheat prize 900
cheat fight
cheat god
expect queue == 18
expect foes == 0
wait 61
expect foes == 1
wait 30
expect foes == 2
wait 300
expect foes == 12
expect queue_left == 6
wait 600
expect foes == 12
expect queue_left == 6
expect enemies_left == 18
# Dice in the top-left corner: they come from the far pads
cheat run 1
cheat round 3
cheat nolineup
cheat group 0 9
cheat prize 100
cheat fight
cheat god
cheat pos 1 30 30
wait 61
expect foes == 1
expect foe0_x > 150
